        "description": "Slot Car VR (Early Access) \n\nBringing back the nostalgia and joy of slot car racing in your home, but this time it's better!\n\nLet your imagination run wild with no limitations on track or props. The intuitive track building tool allows you to create custom circuits with ease. \n\nPlay without controllers - Build track, place props and race, all without picking up a controller (well a physical one at at least!)\n\nMultiplayer - Locally and globally. Play against others in your home or race and build with friends at theirs.\n\nRace to win - Win medals on global tracks. Beat the author and other players times to top the global leaderboards.\n\n*Slot Car VR is still in development and whilst we're sure you will have a great time, we also have a whole host of thigs to come...\n\nCOMING SOON!\n\n- Multi track racing\n- Arcade racing modes\n- Themed packs\n- Championship Leaderboards\n- New game modes\n\nWe love feedback! Please join our discord community to meet other players, tell us how you are getting on and to help us make Slot Car VR even better!!!",
